**Plan, not yet applied.**

`buildRows()` in [report.js](src/report.js) already returns plain data. `cli.js` just pipes it through `toTable`. So `--json` is a branch at the print step, not a new data path.

In `cli.js`:
```js
const jsonFlag = argv.includes('--json');
const rows = buildRows();
process.stdout.write((jsonFlag ? JSON.stringify(rows, null, 2) : toTable(rows)) + '\n');
```

Also update `USAGE` to mention `[--json]`.

